BUNDLED NATIVE LIBRARIES (HEIC support)
=======================================
The binary wheels of pillow-heif bundle the libraries below. They are used only to DECODE HEIC images.
The Docker image therefore contains them, and their licences apply to them:

  libheif      LGPL-3.0   https://github.com/strukturag/libheif   (version in the image: see `pillow_heif.libheif_version()`)
  libde265     LGPL-3.0   https://github.com/strukturag/libde265
  x265         GPL-2.0    https://github.com/Multicorewareinc/x265  (GPL-2.0-or-later according to its source headers)

Source code of these components is available at the URLs above, at the version tags named in the pillow-heif
release that requirements.txt pins. If you cannot obtain it from there, open an issue and the corresponding source
will be supplied.

